---
/**
 * StackDiagram — Personal DX graph (not a forced ladder).
 * Accessible inline SVG: optional HorneroConfig sibling + Workstation ↔ Toolkit ↔ Harness.
 * Static midnight/cyan/violet/lime identity. No external assets.
 */
---

<section aria-labelledby="stack-title" class="ws-stack">
  <div class="ws-stack__head">
    <h2 id="stack-title" class="ws-stack__title">Personal DX graph</h2>
    <p class="ws-stack__lead">
      Nodes, not a mandatory climb. <strong>HorneroConfig</strong> is an optional desktop edge.
      <strong>Workstation</strong> provisions the thin machine. <strong>Toolkit</strong> distributes capabilities and owns
      orchestration.
      <strong>Agentic Harness</strong> is the persistent workspace context — not the Toolkit.
    </p>
  </div>

  <figure class="ws-stack__figure" aria-labelledby="ws-stack-svg-title ws-stack-svg-desc">
    <svg
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      viewBox="0 0 860 420"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="ws-stack-svg-title ws-stack-svg-desc"
      class="ws-stack__svg"
    >
      <title id="ws-stack-svg-title">Agentic Workstation — Personal DX graph</title>
      <desc id="ws-stack-svg-desc"
        >HorneroConfig is an optional desktop path. Thin Agentic Workstation provisions the machine; Agent Toolkit
        distributes capabilities; Agentic Harness provides persistent workspace context.</desc
      >
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="ws-stack-bg" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#020617"></stop>
          <stop offset="1" stop-color="#0F172A"></stop>
        </linearGradient>
        <linearGradient id="ws-stack-accent" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#22D3EE"></stop>
          <stop offset="0.5" stop-color="#A78BFA"></stop>
          <stop offset="1" stop-color="#84CC16"></stop>
        </linearGradient>
      </defs>

      <rect width="860" height="420" rx="20" fill="url(#ws-stack-bg)"></rect>
      <text
        x="28"
        y="28"
        fill="#64748B"
        font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif"
        font-size="10"
        font-weight="700"
        letter-spacing="2">RESPONSIBILITY MAP · OPTIONAL DESKTOP · MACHINE · CAPABILITIES · CONTEXT</text
      >

      <!-- Edges -->
      <g stroke="url(#ws-stack-accent)" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" opacity="0.75">
        <path d="M210 120 L320 200" stroke-dasharray="5 5"></path>
        <path d="M430 230 L520 160"></path>
        <path d="M430 250 L520 320"></path>
        <path d="M620 180 L700 250" stroke-dasharray="4 4" opacity="0.55"></path>
      </g>

      <!-- Hornero optional -->
      <g transform="translate(60 70)">
        <rect
          width="200"
          height="100"
          rx="14"
          fill="#0F172A"
          stroke="#22D3EE"
          stroke-opacity="0.4"
          stroke-dasharray="6 5"></rect>
        <text x="16" y="28" fill="#A5F3FC" font-size="10" font-weight="800">OPTIONAL DESKTOP</text>
        <text x="16" y="54" fill="#F8FAFC" font-size="15" font-weight="800">HorneroConfig</text>
        <text x="16" y="76" fill="#94A3B8" font-size="11">desktop · sibling edge</text>
      </g>

      <!-- Workstation center -->
      <g transform="translate(300 180)">
        <rect width="200" height="110" rx="14" fill="#111827" stroke="#A78BFA" stroke-opacity="0.55"></rect>
        <text x="16" y="28" fill="#EDE9FE" font-size="10" font-weight="800">MACHINE · THIN</text>
        <text x="16" y="54" fill="#F8FAFC" font-size="15" font-weight="800">Workstation</text>
        <text x="16" y="76" fill="#94A3B8" font-size="11">chezmoi · profiles · LLM policy</text>
        <text x="16" y="96" fill="#64748B" font-size="10" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace">no embedded skills</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Toolkit -->
      <g transform="translate(540 110)">
        <rect width="200" height="100" rx="14" fill="#0F1A12" stroke="#84CC16" stroke-opacity="0.5"></rect>
        <text x="16" y="28" fill="#ECFCCB" font-size="10" font-weight="800">CAPABILITIES</text>
        <text x="16" y="54" fill="#F8FAFC" font-size="15" font-weight="800">Agent Toolkit</text>
        <text x="16" y="76" fill="#94A3B8" font-size="11">skills · agents · loops · MCP</text>
      </g>

      <!-- Harness -->
      <g transform="translate(540 270)">
        <rect
          width="200"
          height="100"
          rx="14"
          fill="#0F172A"
          stroke="#22D3EE"
          stroke-opacity="0.4"
          stroke-dasharray="7 5"></rect>
        <text x="16" y="28" fill="#A5F3FC" font-size="10" font-weight="800">PERSISTENT CONTEXT</text>
        <text x="16" y="54" fill="#F8FAFC" font-size="15" font-weight="800">Agentic Harness</text>
        <text x="16" y="76" fill="#94A3B8" font-size="11">memory · personas · packs</text>
      </g>

      <text x="28" y="400" fill="#475569" font-size="10"
        >Identity · midnight #020617 · cyan #22D3EE · violet #A78BFA · lime #84CC16 · graph edges, not a ladder</text
      >
    </svg>
    <figcaption class="ws-stack__caption">
      Graph edges: optional desktop sibling · thin machine provisioning · toolkit uplink · harness runtime. LLM policy
      lives on the workstation node (env.d), not as a separate forced layer.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>

  <ul class="ws-stack__fallback" aria-hidden="false">
    <li><strong>Optional — desktop:</strong> HorneroConfig · Hyprland + Quickshell</li>
    <li><strong>Machine provisioning:</strong> agentic-workstation · chezmoi · profiles · thin helpers</li>
    <li><strong>Capability distribution:</strong> agent-toolkit · skills · agents · loops</li>
    <li><strong>Persistent context:</strong> agentic-harness · workspace / memory</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .ws-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .ws-stack__head {
    max-width: 72ch;
  }
  .ws-stack__title {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.65rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .ws-stack__lead {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 0.96rem;
  }
  .ws-stack__lead strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .ws-stack__figure {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .ws-stack__svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: #020617;
  }
  .ws-stack__caption {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .ws-stack__fallback {
    position: absolute;
    left: -10000px;
    top: auto;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ws-stack__svg * {
      animation: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
